<title>BELGIUM: EU molasses import duties remain suspended.</title>
<headline>EU molasses import duties remain suspended.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union duties on imports of molasses will remain suspended until they are reviewed again on July 3, EU member state officials said.</p>
<p>The cif reference price for cane molasses was set at 8.24 Ecus per 100 kg, compared with 8.30 last week.</p>
<p>For beet molasses, the cif reference price was fixed at 12.14 Ecus per 100 kg, against 12.24 previously.</p>
<p>-Brussels newsroom +322 287 6830</p>
